     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Patient hn-patient-example</b></p><a name=\"hn-patient-example\"> </a><a name=\"hchn-patient-example\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-HNPatient.html\">居家護理－個案</a></p></div><p style=\"border: 1px #661aff solid; background-color: #e6e6ff; padding: 10px;\">陳明慧 Male, DoB: 1945-03-15 ( National Person Identifier where the xxx is the ISO table 3166 3-character (alphabetic) country code)</p><hr/><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"Other Id (see the one above)\">Other Id:</td><td colspan=\"3\">Provider number/HN0001</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"Ways to contact the Patient\">Contact Detail</td><td colspan=\"3\"><ul><li>ph: 02-23456789</li><li>臺北市中正區測試路1號(home)</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"Nominated Contact: Next-of-Kin\">Next-of-Kin:</td><td colspan=\"3\"><ul><li>林淑芬</li><li>ph: 02-23456789</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"Patient Links\">Links:</td><td colspan=\"3\"><ul><li>Managing Organization: <a href=\"Organization-hn-organization-example.html\">Organization 示範居家護理所</a></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"參照提供此資源內容的結構化表單。保留原始評估、來源身分及補充說明。\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-ExtHNSourceForm.html\">居家護理－來源表單</a></td><td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"QuestionnaireResponse-hn-basedata-example.html\">Response to Questionnaire '-&gt;居家護理－個案基本資料' about '-&gt;陳明慧 Male, DoB: 1945-03-15 ( National Person Identifier where the xxx is the ISO table 3166 3-character (alphabetic) country code)'</a></td></tr></table></div>"
